# Copy to .env.local (never commit real secrets; only public values belong in EXPO_PUBLIC_*).
# Optional: force the API mode: mock (6 offline sample cars) | direct (dev builds only: the phone calls NHTSA) | live (backend).
# Default: live when the Supabase values below are set; otherwise direct in dev builds. Also switchable in Settings (dev).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_MODE=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
